WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:06.640
Module three. Campaigns. Ek template ko ek saath kayi customers ko bhejna, results

2
00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:10.699
Padhna, aur API ke through automatically messages bhejna.

3
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:17.562
Campaign se aap ek approved template, customers ki list ko bhejte hain.

4
00:00:17.562 --> 00:00:23.078
Customer care ke liye aap campaigns updates, reminders aur win-back messages ke liye

5
00:00:23.078 --> 00:00:28.069
Use karenge, aur API un messages ke liye jo Oribrix system mein kuch hone pe

6
00:00:28.069 --> 00:00:29.711
Automatically jaate hain.

7
00:00:30.161 --> 00:00:32.166
Pehle, teen campaign types.

8
00:00:32.616 --> 00:00:35.475
Phir CSV broadcast, step by step.

9
00:00:35.925 --> 00:00:38.762
Phir variables, fallback values aur media.

10
00:00:39.212 --> 00:00:41.367
Phir cost estimate aur wallet.

11
00:00:41.817 --> 00:00:44.099
Phir campaign analytics padhna.

12
00:00:44.549 --> 00:00:48.816
Aur aakhir mein, automatic messages ke liye API campaigns.

13
00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:54.560
Campaigns se top right pe Launch pe click kijiye.

14
00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:56.960
Aapko teen campaign types dikhenge.

15
00:00:57.410 --> 00:01:03.144
Broadcast. Platform pe pehle se saved contacts ko bhejna, tags ya attributes se

16
00:01:03.144 --> 00:01:04.087
Filter karke.

17
00:01:04.537 --> 00:01:08.437
CSV broadcast. Excel ya C S V file upload kijiye.

18
00:01:08.437 --> 00:01:12.815
Ye tab use kijiye jab aapke paas logon ki nayi list ho.

19
00:01:13.265 --> 00:01:19.512
API campaign. Oribrix system message automatically bhejta hai, ek ek karke, jab koi

20
00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:22.673
Event hota hai, jaise order dispatch hona.

21
00:01:25.067 --> 00:01:28.331
Ye CSV broadcast shuru se end tak hai.

22
00:01:28.781 --> 00:01:32.536
Launch pe click kijiye, aur CSV broadcast chuniye.

23
00:01:32.986 --> 00:01:37.572
Campaign ko ek clear naam dijiye, jaise November dispatch reminder.

24
00:01:38.022 --> 00:01:42.918
C S V upload kijiye. Do columns zaroori hain: name aur phone number.

25
00:01:42.918 --> 00:01:46.662
Baaki columns, jaise product ya city, optional hain.

26
00:01:47.112 --> 00:01:52.895
Columns map kijiye, taaki platform ko pata ho ki kaun sa column name hai aur kaun sa

27
00:01:52.895 --> 00:01:53.790
Phone number.

28
00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:58.485
Approved template chuniye, aur uske variables columns se bhariye.

29
00:01:58.935 --> 00:02:03.074
Estimated cost check kijiye, phir Send now pe click kijiye.

30
00:02:05.467 --> 00:02:11.459
Kuch details ek achhe campaign aur ek sharminda karne wale campaign ka fark banati

31
00:02:11.459 --> 00:02:11.824
Hain.

32
00:02:12.274 --> 00:02:17.801
Har variable ko ek column se map kijiye. Jaise variable one ko name column se,

33
00:02:17.801 --> 00:02:20.210
Variable two ko product column se.

34
00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:26.030
Ek samajhdar fallback value set kijiye, jo cell khali hone pe use hoti hai.

35
00:02:26.030 --> 00:02:31.114
Customer jaisa fallback khali jagah ya zero se kahin behtar padhta hai.

36
00:02:31.564 --> 00:02:37.026
Agar template mein image ya video header hai, toh asli file isi step pe upload

37
00:02:37.026 --> 00:02:37.516
Kijiye.

38
00:02:37.966 --> 00:02:42.318
Aur phone numbers ek hi format mein rakhiye, country code ke saatha.

39
00:02:42.318 --> 00:02:44.686
Galat numbers bas fail ho jaate hain.

40
00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:52.185
Send now click karne se pehle aakhiri screen pe estimated cost, aapka available

41
00:02:52.185 --> 00:02:55.275
Wallet balance aur per message price dikhta hai.

42
00:02:55.275 --> 00:03:00.167
Ise hamesha check kijiye. Agar wallet kam hai, toh campaign poora nahi hoga.

43
00:03:00.167 --> 00:03:05.316
Aapse sirf un messages ka charge lagta hai jo sent aur delivered hain, failed ka

44
00:03:05.316 --> 00:03:05.703
Nahin.

45
00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:48.959
Analytics kholne ke liye campaign ke naam pe click kijiye.

46
00:03:48.959 --> 00:03:54.081
Aapko dikhega ki ye kab launch hua, kitna time lagna chahiye, aur ye numbers.

47
00:03:54.531 --> 00:03:57.155
Sent. Message platform se nikal gaya.

48
00:03:57.605 --> 00:04:00.613
Delivered. Ye customer ke phone tak pahunch gaya.

49
00:04:01.063 --> 00:04:03.175
Read. Customer ne ise khola.

50
00:04:03.625 --> 00:04:07.749
Replied ya clicked. Customer ne button tap kiya ya vaapas likha.

51
00:04:07.749 --> 00:04:10.068
Ye replies live chat mein aate hain.

52
00:04:10.518 --> 00:04:14.607
Aur failed. Message deliver nahi hua, jaise galat number.

53
00:04:14.607 --> 00:04:16.257
Inka charge nahi lagta.

54
00:04:18.667 --> 00:04:23.574
Campaign page sirf ek report nahi hai. Isse aap ye sab kar sakte hain.

55
00:04:24.024 --> 00:04:29.378
Exactly dekhiye ki kin customers ne receive kiya, read kiya ya reply kiya.

56
00:04:29.828 --> 00:04:31.663
Report download kijiye.

57
00:04:32.113 --> 00:04:37.668
Ek group select kijiye, jaise wo sab jinhonne nahi padha, aur sirf unhe ek alag

58
00:04:37.668 --> 00:04:39.708
Template re-broadcast kijiye.

59
00:04:40.158 --> 00:04:43.507
Track kijiye ki logon ne kaun se buttons click kiye.

60
00:04:43.957 --> 00:04:49.246
Aur failed numbers ki list rakhiye, taaki aap apne records mein unhe theek kar

61
00:04:49.246 --> 00:04:49.653
Saken.

62
00:04:52.067 --> 00:04:57.393
Ab API ke through automatic messages. Isi tarah Oribrix system, jaise order

63
00:04:57.393 --> 00:05:01.795
Dispatched message, bina kisi ke button dabaye bhej sakta hai.

64
00:05:02.245 --> 00:05:05.744
Launch pe click kijiye, aur API campaign chuniye.

65
00:05:06.194 --> 00:05:11.591
Campaign ka naam exactly template jaisa rakhiye, taaki baad mein pahchan saken.

66
00:05:12.041 --> 00:05:18.154
Set live pe click kijiye. Har naya template jise aap API se bhejna chahte hain, aise

67
00:05:18.154 --> 00:05:19.828
Hi set live karna hoga.

68
00:05:20.278 --> 00:05:23.414
Vaapas Campaigns mein jaiye, aur use kholiye.

69
00:05:23.864 --> 00:05:30.912
C U R L test command copy kijiye. API key aur poori documentation Manage, API key,

70
00:05:30.912 --> 00:05:32.632
Read A P I mein hai.

71
00:05:33.082 --> 00:05:37.066
Phir developers ise Oribrix backend se call karte hain.

72
00:05:37.066 --> 00:05:42.861
API key secret rakhiye: jiske paas ye hai, wo Oribrix bankar messages bhej sakta

73
00:05:42.861 --> 00:05:43.151
Hai.

74
00:05:45.567 --> 00:05:51.087
Quick check. Aapki C S V mein one thousand rows hain, aur forty numbers fail hote

75
00:05:51.087 --> 00:05:55.380
Hain. Aapse kitne messages ka charge lagega? Ek second sochiye.

76
00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:04.946
Answer: nine hundred sixty. Aap sirf sent aur delivered messages ka pay karte hain,

77
00:06:04.946 --> 00:06:06.029
Failed ka nahin.

78
00:06:08.833 --> 00:06:11.329
Module three ko summarise karte hain.

79
00:06:11.779 --> 00:06:17.070
Campaigns broadcast, CSV broadcast, ya API campaign ho sakte hain.

80
00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:22.640
C S V mein name aur phone columns chahiye, aur aap unhe map karte hain.

81
00:06:23.090 --> 00:06:27.506
Variables bhariye, fallbacks set kijiye, aur media upload kijiye.

82
00:06:27.956 --> 00:06:32.734
Cost ko wallet se check kijiye. Failed messages ka charge nahi lagta.

83
00:06:33.184 --> 00:06:38.660
Aur API ke liye campaign ka naam template jaisa rakhiye, set live kijiye, aur key

84
00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:42.784
Secret rakhiye. Module four mein live chat aur customer care.

85
00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:51.353
Module 3 yahin khatam hota hai. Agla hai module 4: Live chat, chatbot and customer

86
00:06:51.353 --> 00:06:51.728
Care.
